OL,3,GNEWSATwo passengers die in
OL,4,Asingle-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who were passengers in a car
OL,7,Fhave died in a crash.
OL,9,FNorthamptonshire Police said the
OL,10,Fsingle-vehicle collision involved a
OL,11,Fblack Mini Clubman on the High Street
OL,12,Fin Brackley at about 21:25 BST on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FThe men, aged 19 and 27, were back-seat
OL,16,Fpassengers and died at the scene,
OL,17,Faccording to police.
OL,19,FThe driver and a front-seat passenger
OL,20,Fwere also injured and taken to
OL,21,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
